  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8505.02 Blue Envelope Usage. The participant shall attach the blue envelope to the driver’s side visor, facing the participant when in the down position.\n\nSource. #14643, INTERIM, eff 7-3-26, EXPIRES: 12-30-26\n\nAPPENDIX",
